R2={r1_n}")                                                                     
    print(f"Mode 2: a={c2_n[0]:.8f}, b={c2_n[1]:.8f}, c={c2_n[2]:.8f},          
R2={r2_n}")                                                                     
                                                                                
    print("\nInput check (first 5 samples):")                                   
